#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/result_types.rst:4
msgid "Declaring result types"
msgstr "声明返回类型"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/result_types.rst:7
msgid "Why declare return types"
msgstr "为什么要声明返回类型"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/result_types.rst:9
msgid ""
"Before a job runs, MaxFrame needs the UDF result type: DataFrame, Series, or"
" array. Its columns, dtypes, and index describe the input for later "
"operations."
msgstr ""
"作业执行前，MaxFrame 需要知道 UDF 返回的是 DataFrame、Series "
"还是数组。结果的列、数据类型和索引，决定了后续操作接收到什么输入。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/result_types.rst:12
msgid ""
"Without a return declaration, interfaces that support inference may call the"
" function on the client with made-up sample data. Ungrouped ``apply_chunk`` "
"normally receives one sample row; grouped functions receive sample groups. "
"This happens before ``execute()`` and really runs the function. Model "
"loading, file access, and external requests inside it can therefore happen "
"on the client, or fail because the sample values or local environment are "
"unsuitable."
msgstr ""
"如果没有声明返回类型，支持自动推断的接口可能会在客户端构造样例数据并调用函数。不分组的 ``apply_chunk`` "
"通常使用一行样例，分组接口则使用样例分组。这个过程发生在 ``execute()`` "
"之前，而且会真正执行函数。因此，函数中的模型加载、文件读取或外部请求也可能在客户端发生；样例值或本地环境不符合要求时，还可能直接报错。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/result_types.rst:19
msgid ""
"Declare the result when the function uses external services, remote files, "
"or large models. The declaration does not convert the returned values. The "
"actual pandas or NumPy result must match it, including branches that return "
"no rows."
msgstr ""
"函数涉及外部服务、远程文件或大模型时，建议主动声明返回类型。声明不会转换实际的返回值，函数返回的 pandas 或 NumPy "
"对象必须与声明一致，返回空结果的分支也不例外。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/result_types.rst:24
msgid "Choose how to describe the result"
msgstr "选择返回类型的声明方式"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/result_types.rst:26
msgid "The usual choices are:"
msgstr "常用方式如下："

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/result_types.rst:32
msgid "Method"
msgstr "方式"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/result_types.rst:33
msgid "When to use"
msgstr "适用情况"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/result_types.rst:34
msgid "Client-side trial call"
msgstr "是否在客户端试跑"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/result_types.rst:35
msgid "Return type annotation"
msgstr "返回类型注解"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/result_types.rst:36
msgid ""
"The function can be edited, its return type is fixed, and the interface "
"supports annotations."
msgstr "函数可以修改，返回类型固定，并且所用接口支持类型注解。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/result_types.rst:38
msgid ""
"A complete annotation avoids the trial call only on interfaces that read it."
" See the exceptions below."
msgstr "只有支持读取返回类型注解的接口，才能凭完整注解跳过试调用。例外情况见下文。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/result_types.rst:40
msgid "Explicit type arguments"
msgstr "显式类型参数"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/result_types.rst:41
msgid ""
"The function comes from a shared library, its output columns are computed "
"dynamically, or a static type checker is used."
msgstr "函数来自公共库、不便修改；输出列需要动态生成；或者项目使用静态类型检查。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/result_types.rst:43
msgid ""
"Complete type arguments avoid inference. ``skip_infer=True`` makes the "
"choice explicit on interfaces that support it."
msgstr "完整的类型参数可以避免推断。接口支持时，也可以加上 ``skip_infer=True`` 明确跳过推断。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/result_types.rst:45
msgid "Automatic type inference"
msgstr "自动类型推断"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/result_types.rst:46
msgid ""
"A short experiment with a lightweight function that handles synthetic input "
"and has no external side effects."
msgstr "临时验证简单函数，且函数能处理构造的样例数据，不会读写外部资源或调用服务。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/result_types.rst:48
msgid "The function runs locally while the expression is built."
msgstr "构建表达式时会在本地执行函数。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/result_types.rst:50
msgid ""
"The DataFrame and Series examples below share this sample dataset, where "
"``id`` is stored as the DataFrame ``index``:"
msgstr "下面的 DataFrame 和 Series 示例共用这组数据，``id`` 作为 DataFrame 的 ``index``："

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/result_types.rst:69
msgid ""
"The output blocks show results fetched from a configured MaxFrame session. "
"For example, ``totals_df.execute().fetch()`` runs the first example below."
msgstr ""
"代码下方列出了在已配置的 MaxFrame 会话中执行后的结果。例如，第一个示例可以通过 ``totals_df.execute().fetch()``"
" 获取结果。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/result_types.rst:73
msgid "1. Return type annotations"
msgstr "1. 返回类型注解"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/result_types.rst:75
msgid ""
"For DataFrame and Series ``mf.apply_chunk``, write the return type after "
"``->``. These interfaces read a complete annotation without calling the "
"function. Scalar annotations such as ``-> float`` also work with "
"``Series.map``."
msgstr ""
"DataFrame 和 Series 的 ``mf.apply_chunk`` 可以在 ``->`` "
"后声明返回类型。这两个接口能读取完整注解，无需试调用函数。``Series.map`` 也支持 ``-> float`` 这样的标量注解。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/result_types.rst:79
msgid "Other interfaces have different rules:"
msgstr "其他接口的规则有所不同："

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/result_types.rst:81
msgid ""
"``GroupBy.apply`` still makes a trial call when only a return annotation is "
"provided. Pass explicit result type arguments to avoid it."
msgstr "``GroupBy.apply`` 只写返回类型注解时，仍然会试调用函数。需要显式传入结果类型参数，才能避免试调用。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/result_types.rst:83
msgid ""
"``DataFrame.apply`` does not parse ``pd.DataFrame[...]`` batch annotations. "
"Declare ``output_type`` and ``dtypes`` or ``dtype`` on the call."
msgstr ""
"``DataFrame.apply`` 不解析 ``pd.DataFrame[...]`` 这种批处理注解。应在调用处传入 "
"``output_type`` 和 ``dtypes`` 或 ``dtype``。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/result_types.rst:85
msgid ""
"String annotations, including those produced by ``from __future__ import "
"annotations``, are not resolved, as explained below."
msgstr "字符串形式的注解不会被解析，包括 ``from __future__ import annotations`` 产生的注解，详见下文。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/result_types.rst:90
msgid ""
"With ``from __future__ import annotations``, return annotations are stored "
"as strings. MaxFrame does not currently resolve these strings and may "
"mistake a DataFrame result for a Series. When calling ``mf.apply_chunk`` in "
"these modules, pass ``output_type``, ``dtypes`` / ``dtype``, and "
"``skip_infer=True`` explicitly. See :ref:`udf_explicit_return_types` for "
"examples."
msgstr ""
"使用 ``from __future__ import annotations`` 时，返回类型注解会保存为字符串。MaxFrame "
"目前不会解析这类字符串，可能把 DataFrame 结果误识别为 Series。此时调用 ``mf.apply_chunk`` 应显式传入 "
"``output_type``、``dtypes`` / ``dtype`` 和 ``skip_infer=True``。示例见 "
":ref:`udf_explicit_return_types`。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/result_types.rst:99
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Subscripted annotations such as ``pd.DataFrame[{\"total\": \"float64\"}]``, "
"``pd.DataFrame[{\"id\": \"int64\"}, {\"total\": \"float64\"}]``, and "
"``pd.Series[\"score\": \"float64\"]`` are MaxFrame extensions to pandas type"
" annotations. Static type checkers such as ``mypy`` or ``pyright`` may "
"report them as invalid. :ref:`Explicit type arguments "
"<udf_explicit_return_types>` provide an alternative compatible with these "
"type checks."
msgstr ""
"``pd.DataFrame[{\"total\": \"float64\"}]``、``pd.DataFrame[{\"id\": "
"\"int64\"}, {\"total\": \"float64\"}]`` 和 ``pd.Series[\"score\": "
"\"float64\"]`` 这类带下标的写法，是 MaxFrame 对 pandas 类型注解的扩展。``mypy``、``pyright`` "
"等静态类型检查工具可能将其判为无效类型。如果需要兼容这些检查，可以改用 :ref:`显式类型参数 "
"<udf_explicit_return_types>`。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/result_types.rst:106
msgid "**DataFrame result**"
msgstr "**返回 DataFrame**"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/result_types.rst:108
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Pass a single dict ``pd.DataFrame[{col: dtype, ...}]`` to declare output "
"columns, or two dicts ``pd.DataFrame[{index_name: index_dtype}, {col: dtype,"
" ...}]`` to declare both the output index and output columns:"
msgstr ""
"``pd.DataFrame[{col: dtype, ...}]`` "
"中的一个字典用于声明输出列。需要同时声明索引时，使用两个字典：``pd.DataFrame[{index_name: index_dtype}, "
"{col: dtype, ...}]``，分别描述索引和输出列："

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/result_types.rst:133
msgid ""
"With the single-dict form, pass ``index=df.index`` to ``apply_chunk`` when "
"the function keeps all input rows in the same order. The two-dict form above"
" also declares the index name and type."
msgstr ""
"只使用一个字典、且函数保留所有输入行及其顺序时，可以在 ``apply_chunk`` 上加 "
"``index=df.index``。上面的两个字典写法则同时声明了索引的名称和类型。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/result_types.rst:137
msgid "**Series result**"
msgstr "**返回 Series**"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/result_types.rst:153
msgid ""
"In ``pd.Series[\"score\": \"float64\"]``, ``\"score\"`` is the Series "
"``name`` (not its index name, which remains ``\"id\"``) and ``\"float64\"`` "
"is its value dtype. If both a return annotation and explicit keyword "
"arguments are provided, the keyword arguments take precedence."
msgstr ""
"``pd.Series[\"score\": \"float64\"]`` 中，``\"score\"`` 是 Series 的 "
"``name``，不是索引名；本例的索引名仍是 ``\"id\"``。``\"float64\"`` 是 Series "
"中值的类型。同时提供类型注解和显式参数时，以显式参数为准。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/result_types.rst:161
msgid "2. Explicit keyword arguments and ``skip_infer=True``"
msgstr "2. 显式参数与 ``skip_infer=True``"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/result_types.rst:163
msgid ""
"Use keyword arguments when the function signature cannot be modified or when"
" output columns are constructed dynamically. On ``mf.apply_chunk``, set "
"``skip_infer=True`` alongside the type arguments so MaxFrame does not run a "
"client-side trial call (``skip_infer=True`` alone does not replace "
"``dtypes`` or ``dtype``):"
msgstr ""
"函数签名不能修改，或输出列需要动态生成时，可以使用显式参数。在 ``mf.apply_chunk`` 上，将类型参数与 "
"``skip_infer=True`` 一起设置，可以避免客户端试跑。只设置 ``skip_infer=True`` 不能替代 ``dtypes`` 或"
" ``dtype``："

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/result_types.rst:192
msgid ""
"For a Series result, pass ``output_type=\"series\"``, ``dtype=\"float64\"``,"
" ``name=\"score\"``, ``index=df.index``, and ``skip_infer=True``."
msgstr ""
"返回 Series 时，对应设置 "
"``output_type=\"series\"``、``dtype=\"float64\"``、``name=\"score\"``、``index=df.index``"
" 和 ``skip_infer=True``。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/result_types.rst:196
msgid "3. Automatic type inference"
msgstr "3. 自动类型推断"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/result_types.rst:198
msgid ""
"When neither a return annotation nor explicit type arguments are given, "
"MaxFrame calls the function on synthetic input to inspect its result:"
msgstr "没有提供返回类型注解或显式类型参数时，MaxFrame 会用构造的样例数据调用函数，检查返回结果："

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/result_types.rst:215
msgid ""
"Use automatic inference only for side-effect-free functions whose output "
"schema never depends on actual data values."
msgstr "自动推断适合没有外部副作用、且输出结构不随数据值变化的函数。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/result_types.rst:221
msgid "Keep the result index consistent"
msgstr "保持返回结果的索引正确"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/result_types.rst:223
msgid "Returned pandas row labels and the MaxFrame index declaration must agree"
msgstr "函数返回的 pandas 行标签需要与 MaxFrame 中声明的索引一致"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/result_types.rst:223
msgid ".. image:: ../../_static/user_guide/udf/result-index.svg"
msgstr ""
".. image:: ../../_static/user_guide/udf/result-index.svg\n"
"   :alt: 函数返回的 pandas 行标签需要与 MaxFrame 中声明的索引一致"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/result_types.rst:227
msgid ""
"For one output row per input row, keep the original row labels. When a UDF "
"builds a pandas DataFrame or Series from NumPy arrays or lists, pass "
"``index=batch.index`` inside the function. Otherwise, each batch starts its "
"index at zero, so different batches can produce repeated labels."
msgstr ""
"如果每条输入记录对应一条输出记录，应保留原来的行索引。函数从 NumPy 数组或列表构造 pandas DataFrame、Series 时，需要传入 "
"``index=batch.index``。否则，每批结果都会从 0 开始编号，不同批次之间就可能出现重复索引。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/result_types.rst:232
msgid ""
"The ``index=df.index`` argument on ``apply_chunk`` has a different purpose: "
"it describes the result to MaxFrame before execution. It does not replace "
"the index of the pandas object returned by the function. Use it only when "
"all input rows and their order are preserved."
msgstr ""
"``apply_chunk`` 上的 ``index=df.index`` 是在执行前向 MaxFrame 描述结果，不会修改函数返回的 pandas "
"对象的索引。只有函数保留所有输入行及其顺序时，才应使用这个声明。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/result_types.rst:237
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"If the function filters, expands, or reorders rows, return the corresponding"
" index from the function and declare its names and types. For example, "
"``pd.DataFrame[{\"id\": \"int64\"}, {\"total\": \"float64\"}]`` declares an "
"integer ``id`` index without claiming that every input row remains. Omitting"
" an index declaration can make MaxFrame fall back to the input index type "
"and emit a warning; it does not make an incorrect returned index safe."
msgstr ""
"如果函数会筛选、扩展或重新排序行，应在返回对象中设置对应的索引，并声明索引的名称和类型。例如，``pd.DataFrame[{\"id\": "
"\"int64\"}, {\"total\": \"float64\"}]`` 声明整数类型的 ``id`` "
"索引，但不表示所有输入行都会保留。省略索引声明时，MaxFrame 可能沿用输入索引的类型并给出警告；这不会自动修正函数返回的错误索引。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/result_types.rst:244
msgid ""
"For ``GroupBy.apply`` and ``DataFrameGroupBy.mf.apply_chunk``, pass "
"``prepend_index_group_keys=True`` explicitly to use the group-index behavior"
" in :ref:`udf_group_index`. With ``True`` and the usual ``group_keys=True``,"
" an ``id`` index becomes a ``MultiIndex (customer, id)`` when grouping by "
"customer. Declare only the function's own index and columns, since MaxFrame "
"adds the group level. See :ref:`udf_group_index` for a complete example."
msgstr ""
"使用 ``GroupBy.apply`` 或 ``DataFrameGroupBy.mf.apply_chunk`` 时，显式传入 "
"``prepend_index_group_keys=True``，才能使用 :ref:`udf_group_index` "
"中的分组索引行为。在该参数和通常的 ``group_keys=True`` 配置下，按 customer 分组会将 ``id`` 索引变成 "
"``MultiIndex (customer, id)``。声明返回类型时，只写函数自身的索引和列，分组层级由 MaxFrame 添加。完整示例见 "
":ref:`udf_group_index`。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/result_types.rst:252
msgid ""
"For ``map_reduce``, use ``ignore_index=True`` when the final row labels do "
"not need to be preserved. It resets the result index; it is not an argument "
"shared by all UDF interfaces."
msgstr ""
"``map_reduce`` 的最终行索引不需要保留时，可以设置 ``ignore_index=True`` 重置索引。这个参数并不是所有 UDF "
"接口都支持。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/result_types.rst:257
msgid "Quick reference by UDF interface"
msgstr "各类 UDF 的返回类型和索引"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/result_types.rst:259
msgid ""
"The table below summarizes how the UDF interfaces handle return type "
"declarations, automatic inference, and row indexes:"
msgstr "下表汇总各类 UDF 接口的返回类型声明、自动推断和行索引规则："

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/result_types.rst:266
msgid "Interface"
msgstr "接口"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/result_types.rst:267
msgid "Return declaration"
msgstr "返回类型声明"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/result_types.rst:268
msgid "Auto-inference constraints"
msgstr "自动推断的限制"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/result_types.rst:269
msgid "Row ``index`` behavior"
msgstr "行索引规则"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/result_types.rst:270
msgid "``Series.map`` / ``Series.apply``"
msgstr "``Series.map`` / ``Series.apply``"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/result_types.rst:271
msgid ""
"``dtype=...`` or scalar annotation ``-> float`` (``Series.map``); "
"``output_type=\"dataframe\"`` + ``dtypes=...`` when ``Series.apply`` expands"
" into columns."
msgstr ""
"``dtype=...``，或 ``Series.map`` 的标量注解 ``-> float``；``Series.apply`` 展开为多列时，使用"
" ``output_type=\"dataframe\"`` 和 ``dtypes=...``。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/result_types.rst:274
msgid ""
"``Series.map`` **disallows** auto-inferring ``int`` return values (raises an"
" error unless ``dtype`` or annotation is provided)."
msgstr "``Series.map`` **不支持自动推断整数返回类型**，需要提供 ``dtype`` 或类型注解，否则会报错。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/result_types.rst:276
msgid "Always inherits the input Series index."
msgstr "沿用输入 Series 的索引。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/result_types.rst:277
msgid "``DataFrame.map``"
msgstr "``DataFrame.map``"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/result_types.rst:278
#, python-brace-format
msgid "``dtypes={...}`` per column or ``dtype=...`` for all columns."
msgstr "用 ``dtypes={...}`` 分别声明各列，或用 ``dtype=...`` 为所有列声明相同类型。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/result_types.rst:279
msgid "Uses a small sample for a trial call if omitted."
msgstr "未声明时，使用少量样例数据试跑。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/result_types.rst:280
msgid "Always preserves the input DataFrame shape and index."
msgstr "保持输入 DataFrame 的形状和索引。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/result_types.rst:281
msgid "``DataFrame.apply``"
msgstr "``DataFrame.apply``"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/result_types.rst:282
msgid ""
"``output_type=\"series\"`` + ``dtype`` / ``name``, or "
"``output_type=\"dataframe\"`` + ``dtypes``."
msgstr ""
"``output_type=\"series\"`` 配合 ``dtype``、``name``，或 "
"``output_type=\"dataframe\"`` 配合 ``dtypes``。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/result_types.rst:284
msgid ""
"Infers via trial call if omitted; does not parse ``pd.DataFrame[...]`` batch"
" annotations."
msgstr "未声明时通过试跑推断；不解析 ``pd.DataFrame[...]`` 形式的批处理返回注解。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/result_types.rst:286
msgid ""
"With ``axis=1``, preserves the input row index. With ``axis=0``, a Series "
"result uses column names as its index; a DataFrame result uses the index "
"returned by the function."
msgstr "``axis=1`` 保留输入的行索引。``axis=0`` 返回 Series 时以列名作为索引，返回 DataFrame 时使用函数返回的索引。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/result_types.rst:289
msgid "``DataFrame.mf.apply_chunk`` / ``Series.mf.apply_chunk``"
msgstr "``DataFrame.mf.apply_chunk`` / ``Series.mf.apply_chunk``"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/result_types.rst:290
msgid ""
"``-> pd.DataFrame[...]`` / ``-> pd.Series[...]``, or ``output_type`` + "
"``dtypes`` / ``dtype`` / ``name`` + ``skip_infer=True``."
msgstr ""
"``-> pd.DataFrame[...]`` 或 ``-> pd.Series[...]``；也可以用 "
"``output_type``、``dtypes`` / ``dtype`` / ``name`` 配合 ``skip_infer=True``。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/result_types.rst:292
msgid ""
"Uses a one-row trial call when the result type is missing and inference is "
"enabled."
msgstr "缺少返回类型、且启用了推断时，使用一行样例试跑。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/result_types.rst:294
msgid ""
"Keeps each batch's returned row labels. Use ``index=batch.index`` inside the"
" function to preserve them; the outer ``index=...`` only declares the result"
" index to MaxFrame."
msgstr ""
"保留各批返回的实际行索引。函数内用 ``index=batch.index`` 保留原始索引；外层的 ``index=...`` 只向 MaxFrame"
" 声明结果索引。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/result_types.rst:297
msgid "``DataFrame.mf.flatmap`` / ``Series.mf.flatmap``"
msgstr "``DataFrame.mf.flatmap`` / ``Series.mf.flatmap``"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/result_types.rst:298
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"DataFrame requires ``dtypes={...}``. Series requires ``dtypes={...}`` (rows)"
" or ``dtype=...`` (scalars)."
msgstr ""
"DataFrame 必须提供 ``dtypes={...}``。Series 输出行时提供 ``dtypes={...}``，输出标量时提供 "
"``dtype=...``。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/result_types.rst:300
msgid ""
"**Never auto-infers**; omitting ``dtypes`` / ``dtype`` raises an error "
"immediately."
msgstr "**不自动推断**；缺少 ``dtypes`` / ``dtype`` 时立即报错。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/result_types.rst:302
msgid ""
"Automatically repeats the source row's index label for every emitted row or "
"value."
msgstr "每条输出记录或值都会自动保留来源行的索引。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/result_types.rst:304
msgid "``GroupBy.apply``"
msgstr "``GroupBy.apply``"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/result_types.rst:305
msgid "``output_type`` + ``dtypes`` (or ``dtype`` / ``name``)."
msgstr "``output_type`` + ``dtypes`` （或 ``dtype`` / ``name``）。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/result_types.rst:306
msgid ""
"Runs a multi-row trial call if type arguments are omitted. Return "
"annotations alone do not avoid this call in the current implementation."
msgstr "省略类型参数时，会用多行样本试调用。当前实现中，只写返回类型注解仍会触发试调用。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/result_types.rst:308
msgid ""
"With ``prepend_index_group_keys=True``, prepends group keys to the inner "
"index to form a ``MultiIndex``. Declare only the function's own return "
"columns/index."
msgstr ""
"``prepend_index_group_keys=True`` 会在函数返回的索引前加上分组键，形成 "
"``MultiIndex``。只需声明函数自身返回的列和索引。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/result_types.rst:311
msgid "``DataFrameGroupBy.mf.apply_chunk``"
msgstr "``DataFrameGroupBy.mf.apply_chunk``"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/result_types.rst:312
msgid ""
"``-> pd.DataFrame[...]`` / ``-> pd.Series[...]``, or explicit "
"``output_type`` + ``dtypes`` / ``dtype``."
msgstr ""
"``-> pd.DataFrame[...]`` 或 ``-> pd.Series[...]``；也可以显式提供 ``output_type`` 和 "
"``dtypes`` / ``dtype``。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/result_types.rst:314
msgid "Uses sample groups when the result type is missing and inference is enabled."
msgstr "缺少返回类型、且启用了推断时，使用样例分组试跑。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/result_types.rst:316
msgid ""
"Same ``prepend_index_group_keys=True`` rule as ``GroupBy.apply``; pass "
"``index=batch.index`` inside the function to keep row alignment."
msgstr ""
"``prepend_index_group_keys=True`` 的规则与 ``GroupBy.apply`` 相同；函数内用 "
"``index=batch.index`` 保留对应行的索引。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/result_types.rst:318
msgid "``DataFrame.mf.map_reduce``"
msgstr "``DataFrame.mf.map_reduce``"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/result_types.rst:319
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"``mapper_dtypes={...}`` and ``reducer_dtypes={...}`` (or stage return "
"annotations). With ``combiner``, explicitly set ``mapper_dtypes``; the "
"mapper's return annotation is not retained."
msgstr ""
"分别设置 ``mapper_dtypes={...}`` 和 ``reducer_dtypes={...}``，或为各阶段的函数添加返回类型注解。使用 "
"``combiner`` 时，必须显式设置 ``mapper_dtypes``，mapper 的返回类型注解不会保留。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/result_types.rst:322
msgid "Infers stage schemas via trial calls if omitted."
msgstr "未声明时，通过试跑推断各阶段的输出结构。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/result_types.rst:323
msgid ""
"Use ``mapper_index`` / ``reducer_index``, or ``ignore_index=True`` to reset "
"the final index."
msgstr ""
"使用 ``mapper_index`` / ``reducer_index`` 声明索引，或用 ``ignore_index=True`` "
"重置最终结果的索引。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/result_types.rst:325
msgid "``Tensor.mf.apply_chunk``"
msgstr "``Tensor.mf.apply_chunk``"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/result_types.rst:326
msgid "``dtype=...`` and, when known, ``shape=...`` (or ``elementwise=True``)."
msgstr ""
"使用 ``dtype=...`` 声明元素类型，形状已知时提供 ``shape=...``；逐元素计算也可以使用 "
"``elementwise=True``。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/result_types.rst:327
msgid ""
"Infers ``dtype`` from a dummy array call if omitted; does not use "
"``skip_infer``."
msgstr "未声明 ``dtype`` 时，用样例数组调用函数进行推断；不使用 ``skip_infer``。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/result_types.rst:329
msgid "Operates on N-dimensional array blocks (no pandas index)."
msgstr "处理多维数组块，没有 pandas 索引。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/result_types.rst:332
msgid "Interface-specific declarations"
msgstr "各接口的声明方式"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/result_types.rst:334
msgid ""
"The :ref:`UDF examples <udf_examples>` show each operation and its result. "
"Use the table above to choose the declaration. These cases need extra care:"
msgstr ":ref:`udf_examples` 中给出了各类操作及其结果。可以按上表选择声明方式，以下情况需要特别注意："

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/result_types.rst:337
msgid ""
"``Series.map`` returning an integer needs ``dtype=\"int64\"`` or a scalar "
"return annotation such as ``-> int``."
msgstr "``Series.map`` 返回整数时，需要声明 ``dtype=\"int64\"``，或使用 ``-> int`` 这样的标量返回注解。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/result_types.rst:339
msgid ""
"``GroupBy.apply`` needs explicit type arguments to avoid a trial call, even "
"when the same function works with annotations in grouped ``apply_chunk``."
msgstr "``GroupBy.apply`` 需要显式类型参数才能跳过试调用，即使同一个函数的注解可以用于分组后的 ``apply_chunk``，也仍然如此。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/result_types.rst:341
msgid ""
"With a ``map_reduce`` combiner, set ``mapper_dtypes`` explicitly. The "
"wrapper combining mapper and combiner does not retain the mapper's return "
"annotation."
msgstr ""
"``map_reduce`` 使用 combiner 时，需要显式设置 ``mapper_dtypes``。组合 mapper 和 combiner "
"的包装函数不会保留 mapper 的返回注解。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/result_types.rst:347
msgid "Tensor results"
msgstr "Tensor 结果"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/result_types.rst:349
msgid ""
"For ``Tensor.mf.apply_chunk``, use ``dtype`` for the element type and "
"``shape`` for the complete output shape when known. Tensor results have no "
"pandas index and do not use pandas return annotations or ``skip_infer``. For"
" an elementwise operation that preserves shape, use ``elementwise=True``; "
"see the array example in :ref:`udf_examples`."
msgstr ""
"``Tensor.mf.apply_chunk`` 使用 ``dtype`` 声明元素类型，已知完整输出形状时使用 ``shape``。Tensor "
"结果没有 pandas 索引，也不使用 pandas 返回类型注解或 ``skip_infer``。逐元素操作且形状不变时，可以设置 "
"``elementwise=True``，数组示例见 :ref:`udf_examples`。"
